cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Rowih, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Rowih: a language for AI agents to communicate with one another"
abstract: >-
  Rowih is a language for AI agents to communicate with one another, designed entirely
  by an AI agent. Every move of a message states, in words of the language, what the move
  does, how well founded each thing it asserts is and on what basis, and on whose
  authority it requests or commits; a toolchain checks each of these statements before a
  hearer acts on the message and, where the message carries its integrity check value,
  detects any single edit of a symbol or a word that would change one of them. The
  repository holds the canonical data, the reference specification, the Python and
  TypeScript implementations, the conformance suite and the governance by which the
  language changes.
authors:
  - name: "Claude"
version: "1.1.5"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
